{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/pulls/65","id":5225726130,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVXdqJM8AAAABN3pAsg","html_url":"https://github.com/zil-lang/zil/pull/65","diff_url":"https://github.com/zil-lang/zil/pull/65.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/zil-lang/zil/pull/65.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/issues/65","number":65,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"保留超预算导入后的普通编译分区，并归档生效策略","user":{"login":"cicin411","id":19829978,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODI5OTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19829978?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411","html_url":"https://github.com/cicin411","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cicin411/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 范围\n精确候选 906940ea78dcd5298c9168c4d17197b5983bf954，基线 82a69812582856b012468db3d019930d8e390f64。只提取上一轮受测 287b392b3a78a936766e0497a17742ecd149a7a8 的三个生产文件（blob逐字相同）和现有 docs/guide/build.md 的精简生效决策；不合 .task、研究CI、过程报告或原始数据。\n\n完整直接调用闭包复制超预算时，移动未变机器模块并重走普通分区，不截断或部分发布导入；其他拒绝、当前独立Verify、机器预检、默认CLI策略不变。保留旧单次失败控制并验证普通计划逐字一致及定义唯一。\n\n## 已有证据与限制\nhttps://github.com/zil-lang/zil/actions/runs/42626855362\nhttps://github.com/zil-lang/zil/tree/da1e94124344c812e348bab131f03868de2dccc9/.task/G10.5.1.1/runs/42626855362\n2400编译/2100正式，冻结四频率假设总等待减少19.5%–55.6%，182后端/30 LLVM及真实资源故障消费者通过。只是有限语料、显式增量O2配置；不代表裸CLI默认提升或一般工业项目。旧运行质量筛查不能替代复杂调用图与资源密集场景，扩展复核另行执行。\n\n合入前要求此精确候选的CI与非作者源码复核完成；本PR尚不宣称任何新测试通过。长期编译专项继续，旧研究证据保全。","created_at":"2026-11-09T14:43:59Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T14:59:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/pulls/65/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/pulls/65/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/issues/65/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zil-lang/zil/statuses/906940ea78dcd5298c9168c4d17197b5983bf954","head":{"label":"zil-lang:task/compiler-partition-fallback","ref":"task/compiler-partition-fallback","sha":"906940ea78dcd5298c9168c4d17197b5983bf954","user":{"login":"zil-lang","id":348111517,"node_id":"O_kgDOFL_CnQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348111517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang","html_url":"https://github.com/zil-lang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zil-lang/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1433889316,"node_id":"R_kgDOVXdqJA","name":"zil","full_name":"zil-lang/zil","private":false,"owner":{"login":"zil-lang","id":348111517,"node_id":"O_kgDOFL_CnQ","avatar_ur